        "@value": "Musicians4Musicians Benefit Concert"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This fundraiser for Dixie Burbine and April Scott features more than a dozen of your favourite local musicians all coming together on behalf of Dixie and April as they face challenging health-related expenses. Musicians4Musicians means great music for you and a great cause to be a part of."
      }
