        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Osprey Arts Centre welcomes rising Atlantic Canadian Hip-Hop star, Quake Matthews, fresh off a recent Canadian and US Tour with Chris Webby and a newly released single with his hero B Real from Cypress Hill. Hosted by Ben Nickerson plus Special Guest and a DJ Battle. This one's gonna smoke!  "
