      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "You’ve grown up to their greatest hits. Now those hits are coming live to your Osprey in a celebrated musical tribute show, The Piano Men. Fronted by veteran pianist and performer, Jeff Brewer, this full band experience includes Billy Joel’s and Elton John’s greatest hits in a pitch perfect format."
