        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Rum Ragged | Osprey Arts Centre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Your Osprey is proud to present 2021 JUNO Award Nominees, Rum Ragged, who take a bold approach to the distinct folk music of  their home, Newfoundland.  Their combination of striking vocal harmonies, staggering musicianship, and captivating storytelling is something you won't want to miss."
