        "@value": "Known across the region as the entertainer who brings the Holiday Spirit to his audiences, John Gracie has been singing Christmas traditional  favourites for over 25 years.  This year, he indeed is celebrating the 26th anniversary of his first Christmas album, Have Yourself a Merry Little Christmas."
