      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Join the fun and help the Community with Improv Theatre Classes! Jane Petring has volunteered to offer Improv Jams and a 4-week series of Improv classes at the Osprey Theatre as a Wildfire Relief Fundraiser.  Donate as much as you like—all proceeds will go to the fund."
