      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An engaging experience tailored to captivate the imaginations of children, families, adults, and older adults alike! Led by the endearing characters Aurora the mermaid (Singer/dancer Aurora Scott), and Billy Bones, the friendly pirate. Use the \"Buy Tickets\" button to register."
