        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Therrien-Go Duo | Osprey Arts Centre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Osprey Arts Centre and Debut Atlantic proudly present Therrien-Go Duo, a collaboration by Korean cellist, Daniel Hamin Go and Canadian pianist Jean-Luc Therrien. Featuring works by Debussy, Rachmaninoff, and more, this dynamic partnership has captivated audiences  across Canada."
      }
