        "@value": "Ultra-Sounds for an Ultrasound | Osprey Arts Centre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Shelburne County is chock full of talented musicians and they're coming together for an afternoon of great music to help fund the purchase of an Ultrasound machine at Roseway hospital. General admission, by donation, and your donations will be doubled by a matching grant. 2x the funds and fun."
