        "@value": "Dale Kavanagh and Thomas Kirchhoff bring a program of Handel, Vivaldi, Bach and more for an intimate and virtuosic classical guitar experience. They regularly play together with the Prague Chamber Orchestra and  the Munich Symphony Orchestra, among many others. Tickets: $25/adults, $10/students"
