        "@value": "A Valentines' Cocktail Night | Osprey Arts Centre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Join Mike, Bruce, Alex, & Mike at the Osprey this Valentines Day! Featuring a mix of folk-rock, blues, and classic favourites, their harmonies mixed with guitar and piano is sure to entertain and keep you singing along all evening. Food will be provided by Therese with Fusion Dinning!"
