      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Pretty Archie is a five-piece band from Cape Breton whose genre bending mix of folk, americana, alt-country and rock are all underpinned by the band’s east coast roots. Come see the band Canadian Beats calls, “highly accessible, but undeniably Canadian. Reserved Seating (cabaret-style)."
