        "@value": "Shelburne's own Hupman brothers bring their band and their super-tight bluesy rock n' roll back to Shelburne in a long-awaited return to the Osprey Arts Centre. New \"Dance Hall\" reserved seating plan is in effect. Tickets on sale now.  Let's get this party started!"
