        "@value": "Mike Biggar | Osprey Arts Centre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Contemporary Roots & Blues artist Mike Biggar is a natural live performer. With a musical history in a gospel music upbringing, and soulful vocals that testify still to the deep imprint of those early musical days, he is a picture of a lifetime spent in performance. Tickets: $30/adults, $15/students"
      }
