    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Osprey Arts Centre welcomes back captivating singer/songwriter, Joe H Henry in trio format. With his cannonball voice, songwriter’s heart, and stories from a storied past, If you missed him first time around, you won't want to do so again. If you saw him, no doubt you'll be back for more."
      }
